For Ramp tasks, read the installed `ramp-openteam` skill before following a provider playbook. Use the selected account's live MCP schemas and verify financial actions. Translate upstream CLI examples into MCP calls; do not install or invoke the Ramp CLI. Use the receipt upload-link workflow for local files and OpenTeam's available browser capability for checkout and authentication.
